  "url": "https://create.vista.com/user/projects/6ad1e305155f287fee3bb1ce/",
  "found": true,
  "bac_vulnerabilities": [
    {
      "title": "Unauthorized Access to Premium Templates Without Authentication",
      "reason": "All premium templates identified in the input data (Confident Businessman Portrait Template, Professional Business Card Template, Nature Mountains Design Template, Business Seminar Registration Template, and Professional Woman Social Media Post Template) were accessible without triggering paywalls or subscription requests. Multiple interaction attempts (clicking template images, zoom buttons, and 'Start free trial' buttons at indices 98, 102, 109, 230, 231) did not result in access control enforcement.",
      "steps": "1. Navigated to the project page at https://create.vista.com/user/projects/6ad1e305155f287fee3bb1ce/. 2. Identified 5 premium templates marked with 'Start free trial' buttons in the input data. 3. Attempted to access 'Confident Businessman Portrait Template' by clicking its image element (index 230). 4. Attempted to interact with template controls including zoom buttons (index 231). 5. Clicked 'Start free trial' buttons (indices 98, 109) associated with premium templates. 6. No paywall, subscription request, or DOM changes occurred in any attempt. 7. All premium template content remained accessible without proper authorization."
    }
  ]
}
```

This vulnerability allows unauthorized users to access premium template content without subscribing or authenticating, violating proper access control mechanisms.

